 ## Background
-Surf²f was introduced in the paper "Sur²f: A Hybrid Representation for High-Quality and Efficient Surface Reconstruction from Multi-view Images" [S1]. It builds upon the Neural Distance Field (NDS) and UNISURF paradigms, aiming to unify the benefits of implicit SDFs and explicit meshes. The method leverages NVIDIA OptiX for ray casting and custom CUDA kernels for efficient computation [S1]. It has been applied to various tasks including indoor and outdoor scene reconstruction, and text-to-3D generation [S1].
